ea:DevelopmentalRubric rdfs:comment "TENSION (resolved): one passage lists holistic, analytic and developmental rubrics as three coordinate classifications (modeled via owl:disjointUnionOf, forcing DevelopmentalRubric disjoint from AnalyticRubric), while the same passage also calls developmental rubrics 'a subset of analytical rubrics'. The subClassOf axiom has been removed to preserve satisfiability, retaining the disjoint-union partition." .

ea:DiagnosticAssessment rdfs:comment "TENSION (resolved): one passage lists diagnostic assessment as a coordinate category alongside placement, formative and summative assessment (modeled here via the hasPurpose value-partition, which forces pairwise disjointness with FormativeAssessment's purpose value). Another passage states diagnostic assessment is a form of formative assessment. The rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment axiom has been removed to preserve satisfiability, retaining the purpose-based equivalentClass definition." ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment [ a owl:Restriction ;
