ea:ConstructValidity rdfs:comment "NOTE: this second disjointUnionOf statement adds Convergent/Discriminant validity as the 'two subtypes of validity that make up construct validity'; OWL allows multiple disjointUnionOf statements, understood as further exhaustive partitions of the class.",
        "TENSION (partially resolved): one passage enumerates content, criterion, construct, consequential and face validity as coordinate categories of evidence (modeled above as pairwise disjoint via owl:AllDisjointClasses). Other passages state that construct validity 'subsumes all other types of validity'. To preserve satisfiability, the rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity axioms for ContentValidity, CriterionValidity and FaceValidity have been removed, retaining the disjointness and the subsumption claim only in this comment." ;
